{"4415850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grimorium", "steam_appid": 4415850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grimorium</strong> is a dungeon-crawling, spell-crafting roguelike set in a fully simulated voxel world where nearly everything can be manipulated, destroyed, or weaponized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the elements and descend into ever more dangerous depths as your power evolves. Build devastating or precise spells using a flexible casting system with deep combinatorial freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated dungeons packed with secrets, battle deadly foes, and turn the environment itself into your greatest weapon.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grimorium</strong> is a dungeon-crawling, spell-crafting roguelike set in a fully simulated voxel world where nearly everything can be manipulated, destroyed, or weaponized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the elements and descend into ever more dangerous depths as your power evolves. Build devastating or precise spells using a flexible casting system with deep combinatorial freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated dungeons packed with secrets, battle deadly foes, and turn the environment itself into your greatest weapon.</p>", "short_description": "Grimorium is a spell-crafting roguelike built in a custom micro-voxel engine where every voxel is simulated and destructible. Craft spells, manipulate materials, and explore procedurally generated dungeons in a world that reacts to every action.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415850/5c437c9b85caf78a1c14a50b40aa583f7b0825ad/header.jpg?t=1786479841", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste